This is a listing of total molecular energies for the 753-molecule MMFF94 test 
suite as computed by OPTIMOL and BatchMin. No cutoffs on nobonded interactions 
were used in either set of calculations. All energies shown are in kcal/mol. 
The OPTIMOL run was made on a R4000 sgi processor, while the BatachMin run was
made on a R10000. However, a companion BatchMin run made on a R4000 produced 
identical BatchMin energies to the precision shown. 

The total energies differ by 0.0001 kcal/mol or more in 15 cases (marked by
an asterisk); the largest difference is about 0.0035 kcal/mol.  All such cases 
are ones in which a positive or negative formal charge is shared among three 
atoms of the same MMFF atom type (e.g., three nitrogens of a guanidinium group); 
the single-precision division by 3 in the BatchMin run produces a less precise 
final partial atomic charge and a less accurate total MMFF94 energy.

